# Save the Children (battlefield.save_the_children): the battlefieldWin contract across fights. Two level 75 Warriors
# of San d'Oria by Hut_Door (Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out): main with 1-3 current at Status 2 (the registrant),
# bob with 1-3 completed, not current, and The Holy Crest completed (a helper). main leads bob; both enter area 1; the
# three Fodderchiefs killed: won. BattlefieldMission's onBattlefieldWin sets battlefieldWin 32 for main only (1-3
# current); bob's is left unset (1-3 not current). main's 32001 finish: 1-3's handler (the key, the title, Status 3);
# bob's: nothing. The won arena's cleanup takes them out. GMs: 1-3 current for bob, Status 2. bob enters The Holy Crest
# (index 1, area 1; its entryRequirement accepts a completed quest) and a GM wins it (bfwin): BattlefieldQuest sets no
# battlefieldWin for a completed quest that is not repeatable. bob's 32001 finish reaches 1-3's Status 2 handler:
# battlefieldWin is not 32: nothing (no key, no title, Status 2 kept). Pins the current == mission test of the win:
# with it dropped, bob's first win would leave battlefieldWin 32 behind and this finish would advance 1-3.
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/onEventUpdate/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
bob: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
bob: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
bob: quest Sandoria.TheHolyCrest completed
login
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # registered in area 1; bob registered with it
finish                                  # main entered
bob: trigger Hut_Door                   # bob's clearance: no registrant, completed: the menu
bob: update 32000 option=1              # entered
bob: finish
tick 2000                               # the Fodderchiefs spawn
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+1
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+2               # won: 32001 to main (battlefieldWin 32) and bob (none)
finish                                  # 1-3: the key, the title, Status 3
bob: finish                             # bob: nothing
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield (no warp: a zone change clears local vars)
bob: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current # a GM
bob: missionstatus Sandoria 2           # a GM
bob: trigger Hut_Door                   # The Holy Crest completed: the menu 32000
bob: update 32000 option=17             # The Holy Crest (index 1), area 1: registered, entered
bob: finish                             # in the arena
bob: bfwin                              # a GM's win: completed, not repeatable: no battlefieldWin; 32001
bob: finish                             # 1-3's Status 2 handler: battlefieldWin is not 32: nothing
